    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">HACK&lt;N&gt;PITCH is Eastern India&rsquo;s premier 24-hour hackathon, set to take place on 20th&ndash;21st November 2026 at Jadavpur University&rsquo;s Salt Lake Campus (JUSL), Kolkata.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Designed to ignite innovation and entrepreneurial thinking, the event will bring together 30 elite teams (120 participants max) from across the country to compete, collaborate, and create impactful tech solutions under intense time constraints.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With a strong focus on real-world problem-solving, this hackathon is structured around six cutting-edge tracks:</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1) Web/App Dev</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2) Open Innovation</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3) AI &amp; Applications (umbrella for Agentic, NLP, CV, Data Science, etc)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4) Game Development</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5) Cybersecurity</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">6) Web3</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What Makes HACKPITCH Stand Out:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Beyond its purpose, HACK&lt;N&gt;PITCH stands out for its scale and inclusivity.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As the biggest product-focused hackathon in Eastern India, it encourages diversity and balanced teamwork.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teams will compete to become the sole undisputed winner and claim the grand cash prize by brainstorming, prototyping, and pitching their solutions to a panel of expert judges over the course of the 24-hour sprint.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medals and certificates of excellence will also be awarded to other top-performing teams.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Purpose and Vision:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">HACK&lt;N&gt;PITCH is more than just a hackathon - it serves as a springboard for the next generation of innovators and builders.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The goal is to foster an innovative, technically superior, and entrepreneurial community through this event.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The hackathon aims to:</span></li>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enhance participant experience.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Provide top-notch mentorship.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Establish HACK&lt;N&gt;PITCH as a globally recognized student-led tech initiative.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</ul>",
